Package: com.kolby.glyph
Name: Glyph
Depends: mobilesubstrate, preferenceloader
Version: 0.2.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: SnowBoard successor — UIKit icon engine (SBIconImageView) with Phase D recolouring: iOS 18-style tinted/dark icons in any colour and iOS 26-style clear glass, composited once and cached. Reads existing SnowBoard IconBundles theme packs unchanged. Default off. Not published.
Maintainer: Kolby
Author: Kolby
Section: Tweaks
